lima puluh peratus lebih

20:41.430 --> 20:42.830
daripada harga pasaran.

20:47.220 --> 20:48.350
Lima puluh peratus?

20:51.590 --> 20:52.720
Ketua Editor Zheng,

20:52.780 --> 20:54.980
tolong tarik balik kata-kata awak tadi.

20:54.980 --> 20:56.190
Syarikat Penerbitan Fuxiang tawarkan

20:56.190 --> 20:57.740
