sertai Aliran Bintang Menteri.

28:37.390 --> 28:38.740
Awak agak naif.

28:39.590 --> 28:41.500
Sebab nak menegakkan keadilan,

28:41.900 --> 28:43.960
awak sertai Aliran Bintang Menteri.

